<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">Kalahom</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Kalahom was one of the two great ministries of the Siamese state from the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ayutthaya-kingdom">Ayutthaya</a> period, headed by the Samuha Kalahom and responsible originally for military affairs and later for the administration of the southern provinces. Traditionally attributed to the reforms of King <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/borommatrailokkanat">Borommatrailokkanat</a> in the fifteenth century, it became the Ministry of Defence in King <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/chulalongkorn">Chulalongkorn</a>'s reforms of 1892.</p></div>
